			</nav>
			<div class="nav-actions">
				<a class="btn btn-primary" href="Book.jsp">Book your stay <span
					aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a>
				<button class="menu-toggle" type="button" data-menu-toggle
					aria-expanded="false" aria-label="Open navigation menu">☰</button>
			</div>
		</div>
	</header>
	<main>
		<section class="page-hero">
			<div class="container">
				<div class="breadcrumb"><a href="index.html">HOME / </a><a href="About.jsp"> OUR STORY</a></div>
				<span class="eyebrow">Hospitality, with heart</span>
				<h1 class="display">A place to feel at home.</h1>
				<p>We bring thoughtful comfort and warm service together to make
					every stay feel a little more personal.</p>
			</div>
		</section>
		<section class="section">
			<div class="container intro-grid">
				<div class="intro-image">
					<img src="reception.jpg" alt="Welcoming Happy Homes reception area">
					<div class="image-stamp">
						<strong>Since</strong><span>every guest matters</span>
					</div>
				</div>
				<div class="intro-copy">
					<span class="eyebrow">Our story</span>
					<h2 class="display">Good hospitality begins with listening.</h2>
					<p>Happy Homes was created around a simple idea: travel should
						leave you with good memories, not extra worries. From the first
						welcome to the last goodbye, we want the experience to feel
						comfortable, thoughtful and easy.</p>
					<p>Our spaces are designed for different kinds of journeys — a
						quiet weekend, a family holiday or a trip that brings work and
						rest together. Whatever brings you here, our team is here to help
						you settle in.</p>
					<ul class="check-list">
						<li>Personal, friendly service</li>
						<li>Clean and comfortable spaces</li>
						<li>Clear, straightforward booking</li>
						<li>Facilities for different needs</li>
					</ul>
					<a class="btn btn-dark" href="Book.jsp">Plan your stay <span
						aria-hidden="true">→</span></a>
				</div>
			</div>
		</section>
		<section class="section" id="facilities"
			style="background: var(--cream)">
			<div class="container">
				<div class="section-head">
					<span class="eyebrow">Thoughtful comforts</span>
					<h2 class="display">Facilities for a better stay</h2>
					<p>From downtime to dining, find the essentials and extras that
						help you feel settled.</p>
				</div>
				<div class="facility-grid">
					<article class="facility">
						<div class="facility-icon">⌁</div>
						<h3>Complimentary Wi-Fi</h3>
						<p>Access internet throughout the hotel for work, planning and
							keeping in touch.</p>
					</article>
					<article class="facility">
						<div class="facility-icon">♨</div>
						<h3>Swimming pool</h3>
						<p>Make room for a refreshing swim and a slower afternoon.</p>
					</article>
					<article class="facility">
						<div class="facility-icon">♧</div>
						<h3>Dining spaces</h3>
						<p>Enjoy a welcoming setting for meals and time together.</p>
					</article>
					<article class="facility">
						<div class="facility-icon">✧</div>
						<h3>Fitness centre</h3>
						<p>Keep up with your routine while away from home.</p>
					</article>
					<article class="facility">
						<div class="facility-icon">⌖</div>
						<h3>Parking</h3>
						<p>Ask our team for current parking availability and access
							details.</p>
					</article>
					<article class="facility">
						<div class="facility-icon">♧</div>
						<h3>Guest assistance</h3>
						<p>Our team can help with stay-related questions and requests.</p>
					</article>
					<article class="facility">
						<div class="facility-icon">◈</div>
						<h3>Garden and leisure</h3>
						<p>Take a pause in our shared leisure areas.</p>
					</article>
					<article class="facility">
						<div class="facility-icon">▦</div>
						<h3>Events and gatherings</h3>
						<p>Contact us to discuss requirements for your planned
							gathering.</p>
					</article>
				</div>
			</div>
		</section>
		<section class="section" id="contact">
			<div class="container">
				<div class="section-head">
					<span class="eyebrow">We're here to help</span>
					<h2 class="display">Get in touch</h2>
					<p>Have a question about dates, room types or facilities? Reach
						out to our team.</p>
				</div>
				<div class="room-grid">
					<article class="facility">
						<div class="facility-icon">☎</div>
						<h3>Call us</h3>
						<p>
							<a href="tel:+917399182000">+91 73991 82000</a>
						</p>
					</article>
					<article class="facility">
						<div class="facility-icon">✉</div>
						<h3>Email us</h3>
						<p>
							<a href="mailto:happyhomehotel@gmail.com">happyhomehotel@gmail.com</a>
						</p>
					</article>
					<article class="facility">
						<div class="facility-icon">⌖</div>
						<h3>Find us</h3>
						<p>Morni Hills, Chandigarh, India</p>
						<p class="no-results">Please confirm the hotel's official
							address and contact details before publishing.</p>
					</article>
				</div>
			</div>
